OL,3,GNEWSAOasis travel 'masterplan' drawn up
OL,4,Afor Knebworth
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal authorities are drawing up a
OL,7,Ftravel "masterplan" to prevent traffic
OL,8,Fcongestion when Oasis perform four
OL,9,Fnights at Knebworth House in 2027.
OL,11,FStevenage Borough Council said it was
OL,12,Fworking with Hertfordshire County
OL,13,FCouncil, highways officials and the
OL,14,Fvenue after previous concerts left
OL,15,Froads heavily congested.
OL,17,FThe authority's leader, Richard Henry,
OL,18,Fsaid: "We've got a 'masterplan' in
OL,19,Fterms of planning because it's a bigger
OL,20,Fconcert.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
